dc_device_param: a divider's upper resistor swept over listed values (v(out) = 1 * 1k/(r + 1k): 0.5, 1/3, 1/4)
load "spice/resistor.osdi"
model vsource vsource
model resistor sp_resistor
v1 (in 0) vsource dc=1.0
r1 (in out) resistor r=1k
r2 (out 0) resistor r=1k
control
  sweep sw instance="r1" parameter="r" values=[1k, 2k, 3k]
    analysis dc1 op
endc
